{"3324350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Three Kingdoms Poker", "steam_appid": 3324350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lord! Gather your hand, defeat all kinds of forces (and win their people over), and become the ruler of the Three Kingdoms! That’s your mission!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you’ll use the cards in your deck to form specific card combinations, dealing damage to enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you defeat an enemy, they’ll join your ranks (and maybe even your harem)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 <strong>Clothing Break System</strong><br>Every character comes with a Clothing Break system. As you progress through the game, characters will switch into <strong>Break 1</strong> and <strong>Break 2</strong> stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Below are some preview images of the Clothing Break effects for certain characters:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324350/extras/013a32430f82789aedb86f3b4bdccab3.poster.avif?t=1761813591\" width=1170 height=649 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324350/extras/013a32430f82789aedb86f3b4bdccab3.webm?t=1761813591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324350/extras/0afdca41fc704f452213de131610ce8e.poster.avif?t=1761813591\" width=1170 height=649 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324350/extras/0afdca41fc704f452213de131610ce8e.webm?t=1761813591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></vide